# Cesium for Unreal: the request cache, and the Cesium ion server asset, which holds the
# access token of the user. Cesium creates the asset when the project is opened; each user
# signs in to Cesium ion from the Cesium panel.
cesium-request-cache.sqlite*
Content/CesiumSettings/

